01:35.990 --> 01:37.360
My name is Asami.

01:37.360 --> 01:39.910
I'm a 17-year-old high school girl.

01:40.620 --> 01:44.290
I keep it secret from everyone, but...

01:44.290 --> 01:45.960
I'm actually married.

01:47.080 --> 01:51.340
My husband, Ichimaru Kyousuke-sensei,
teaches at my school.

01:58.760 --> 02:01.260
Oh right, we ran out of miso.

02:02.600 --> 02:04.430
Good morning.

02:04.430 --> 02:05.480
Morning.

02:05.480 --> 02:07.980
Darling, I'm going to
go buy some miso.

02:07.980 --> 02:09.690
Eh? Right now?

02:10.100 --> 02:11.900
I'll be back in a jiffy.

02:11.900 --> 02:16.280
The new convenience store in the area opens at 6:00.

02:16.610 --> 02:21.030
Eh? Really?
Maybe I should check it out, too.

02:21.450 --> 02:23.620
Ah, great idea!

02:23.620 --> 02:27.370
I always wanted to go shopping in the morning with you.

02:27.410 --> 02:32.340
Will You Marry Me...?

02:33.630 --> 02:36.210
Welcome, welcome, welcome.

02:36.210 --> 02:38.720
Thank you all.
Today is our grand opening.

02:38.720 --> 02:43.510
We'll be serving the whole
neighborhood 24 hours a day.

02:43.510 --> 02:44.970
Welcome-!

02:49.770 --> 02:52.190
A-An angel!

02:53.900 --> 02:55.480
Sakura-san?

02:55.480 --> 02:57.150
Ah, Asami-oneechan.

02:57.150 --> 02:59.530
You're out shopping this early?

02:57.440 --> 03:00.070
<i>I see... her name's "Asami."</i>

03:00.490 --> 03:02.570
We're out of miso.

03:02.570 --> 03:06.080
I have to commend you for taking the time
to make a proper breakfast.

03:06.080 --> 03:08.870
All we have is rice balls,
every single morning.

03:08.870 --> 03:10.870
Don't enter contests you can't win.

03:10.870 --> 03:14.880
<i>Who's that man standing beside her?
Could he be her boyfriend?</i>

03:11.250 --> 03:14.090
Leisurely mornings like this are pretty nice.

03:14.090 --> 03:16.380
That's for sure. We'll see you later.

03:18.460 --> 03:19.760
Welcome.

03:20.930 --> 03:22.180
Your total's 200 yen.

03:22.180 --> 03:25.930
Let's see... Here, I've got exact change.

03:28.930 --> 03:31.020
What a fabulous smile!

03:31.020 --> 03:32.940
Thank you very much.

03:33.730 --> 03:35.690
Hey, a little service here?

03:35.690 --> 03:36.110
Yes?

03:36.360 --> 03:38.320
We're in a hurry,
so make it quick.

03:38.320 --> 03:40.030
Y-Yes!

03:41.150 --> 03:45.370
J-Just curious... what kind of relationship do those two have?

03:45.370 --> 03:48.490
Asami and Ichimaru-sensei?

03:48.490 --> 03:53.250
What kind, you ask?
Well, they're obviously brother and sister.

03:53.710 --> 03:54.750
They're siblings?!

03:54.750 --> 03:58.670
Yeah - a high school student and her teacher, who're also siblings.

03:58.670 --> 03:59.760
Y-Yeah.

03:59.760 --> 04:04.010
Just brother and sister? Thank goodness!

04:04.430 --> 04:08.560
The opening day is memorable enough, but to add this chance encounter to it...

04:09.100 --> 04:10.060
Asami.

04:10.060 --> 04:11.020
Sankichi-san.

04:11.020 --> 04:14.060
Destiny, in its most marvelous form!

04:15.020 --> 04:16.650
I'm goin' for broke!

04:17.610 --> 04:18.900
You're gonna make ME broke!

04:21.360 --> 04:22.820
E-Excuse me, Asami-san?

04:24.200 --> 04:26.320
You're from the convenience store...

04:26.320 --> 04:28.080
I'm the manager, Sankichi.

04:28.410 --> 04:30.160
U-Umm...

04:30.450 --> 04:31.330
Huh?

04:31.330 --> 04:37.040
W-Will you warm up
boxed lunches with me?

04:37.460 --> 04:38.420
Huh!?

04:38.840 --> 04:43.760
Like making steamed meat buns,
roasting frankfurters...

04:43.760 --> 04:47.350
...and aiming to open 20,000
convenience store locations nationwide?!

04:47.350 --> 04:49.310
Please be my partner.

04:49.310 --> 04:50.850
P-Partner?

04:51.350 --> 04:55.020
In other words, I mean, will, will, will...

04:55.020 --> 04:56.560
Will I what?

04:56.560 --> 04:58.730
...will you marry me?

04:59.070 --> 05:01.650
Eh?! Marry you!?!?

05:01.940 --> 05:04.360
I-I decided the moment
I laid eyes on you.

05:04.700 --> 05:09.410
Umm, t-that's not an
easy question to answer...

05:09.870 --> 05:11.410
Please, Asami-san!

05:13.830 --> 05:15.580
P-Please excuse me!

05:16.250 --> 05:19.130
P-Please stop, Asami-san!

05:25.340 --> 05:26.720
What should I do?

05:27.220 --> 05:31.640
He proposed to me out of nowhere,
but I can't tell him I'm already married.

05:33.600 --> 05:36.730
I hope my husband gets back soon.

05:40.230 --> 05:44.070
I should've known that talking
about marriage wasn't a good opener.

05:44.900 --> 05:46.530
Ah, Onii-san.

05:47.030 --> 05:48.530
This is so convenient.

05:49.200 --> 05:50.410
Huh?

05:53.330 --> 05:56.250
Onii-san, have you ever been in love?

05:57.370 --> 05:59.250
Well, kind of.

05:59.250 --> 06:02.210
Actually, I'm in love
with someone right now.

06:02.500 --> 06:04.090
Oh, really?

06:04.090 --> 06:06.220
She's a high school student, though.

06:06.220 --> 06:07.720
A-A high school student?!

06:08.130 --> 06:09.390
Is that so wrong?

06:09.390 --> 06:13.220
Ah, no, love works in mysterious ways...

06:13.510 --> 06:17.140
I went for a "no guts, no glory" proposal,

06:17.140 --> 06:19.310
although I think she hates me now.

06:19.310 --> 06:22.150
But you do love her, don't you?

06:22.150 --> 06:22.860
Yes.

06:22.860 --> 06:27.990
In that case, don't ever give up,
even if you get rejected a time or two.

06:28.700 --> 06:30.410
Onii-san...

06:31.200 --> 06:32.740
You're right!

06:32.740 --> 06:34.700
If I really do love her,

06:34.700 --> 06:38.750
then I have to push and push and push some more!

06:40.540 --> 06:42.420
That's wonderful, Sankichi-san.

06:45.420 --> 06:47.090
Thank you very much.

06:47.090 --> 06:49.510
With your righteous guidance, Onii-san,

06:49.510 --> 06:52.300
I'll be unbeatable. And also invincible!

06:52.300 --> 06:53.470
Away I go!

06:59.020 --> 07:00.190
I'm home.

07:00.640 --> 07:01.940
Sorry for being late.

07:01.940 --> 07:03.520
Darling!

07:04.110 --> 07:05.780
What's the matter?!

07:05.780 --> 07:08.780
I got lonely all by myself.

07:09.900 --> 07:13.030
Eh!? You were with that store manager?

07:13.030 --> 07:15.990
I was asked for my advice.

07:15.990 --> 07:18.580
He said he was in love
with a high school girl.

07:20.080 --> 07:23.580
He proposed to her,
but she wound up hating him.

07:23.920 --> 07:26.090
A-And who <i>is</i> this high school girl?

07:26.090 --> 07:28.300
I didn't get all the details.

07:30.420 --> 07:34.430
So I told him that if he loves her,
he should never give up,

07:34.430 --> 07:36.600
even if he gets rejected a few times.

07:36.890 --> 07:40.390
Eh!? You egged him on!?

07:40.390 --> 07:42.140
Sorry to bother you!

07:42.940 --> 07:45.020
Is Asami-san here?

07:45.020 --> 07:47.360
Huh? Is that the manager's voice?

07:47.730 --> 07:51.530
Darling, please tell him that I'm not home yet!

07:51.530 --> 07:52.240
Huh?

07:52.240 --> 07:53.280
Please!

07:54.370 --> 07:58.620
C-Could it be? Was the high school girl
he proposed to...

07:58.620 --> 08:00.540
...Asami?

08:01.830 --> 08:04.960
Ah, Onii-san.
Thanks for the help back there.

08:04.960 --> 08:06.290
N-No problem.

08:06.290 --> 08:07.960
Say, where's Asami-san?

08:07.960 --> 08:10.630
Well, she's not home yet.

08:10.630 --> 08:12.380
I see. The truth is...

08:12.380 --> 08:16.220
The high school girl I love is actually... Asami-san.

08:17.680 --> 08:19.680
Should've seen THAT one coming.

08:21.180 --> 08:25.650
Onii-san, please allow me to marry Asami-san.

08:25.650 --> 08:26.980
I'm begging you!

08:26.980 --> 08:27.900
B-But...

08:27.900 --> 08:32.400
I'll make the store really successful,
so I'm sure I can make Asami-san happy.

08:32.400 --> 08:36.620
N-Nonetheless, Asami's still in high school, you know?

08:36.620 --> 08:40.790
Be that as it may, you told me that love works in mysterious ways!

08:41.120 --> 08:44.920
But I never imagined
you were referring to Asami.

08:44.920 --> 08:47.170
I feel the hand of destiny at work!

08:47.170 --> 08:49.800
On the morning when I'd finally opened my own store,

08:49.800 --> 08:52.510
whom does my fate bring
through the door? Asami-san!

08:52.510 --> 08:54.550
But Asami is, how should I say it...?

08:54.550 --> 08:58.470
Then if Asami-san says okay,
can I count on your blessing?

08:58.470 --> 08:59.810
That'd be a no.

08:59.810 --> 09:03.560
No matter what happens,
I will not give up on Asami-san.

09:04.640 --> 09:08.360
You're the one who said not to let rejection get me down, Onii-san!

09:08.360 --> 09:13.070
I'll propose 1000 times, 10,000 times,
or even 1,000,000 times...

09:13.070 --> 09:14.990
...until Asami-san says "yes."

09:16.200 --> 09:17.870
You can't.

09:18.820 --> 09:21.080
You can ask 1000, 10,000, or 1,000,000 times...

09:21.080 --> 09:23.370
...or even infinity times,
but I won't allow it!

09:23.370 --> 09:25.160
O-Onii-san...?

09:25.160 --> 09:27.710
Get it through your head: no means no!

09:27.710 --> 09:28.710
Darling...!

09:29.170 --> 09:30.540
But why?

09:30.540 --> 09:31.880
You're asking me why?

09:31.880 --> 09:33.710
Please tell me the reason.

09:33.710 --> 09:38.550
W-Well, you see, Asami is... Asami is...

09:38.550 --> 09:40.180
I'm sorry.

09:40.720 --> 09:41.680
Asami!

09:41.680 --> 09:42.680
Asami-san.

09:43.060 --> 09:46.600
I'm sorry, Manager.
It's a harsh reality, but I...

09:47.140 --> 09:50.690
...already have someone whom I love.
My heart's decided on him.

09:50.690 --> 09:51.860
Eh!??!

09:52.400 --> 09:57.360
I feel that I want to be with him forever,
until death parts us.

09:58.820 --> 10:00.660
Asami-san~!

10:01.160 --> 10:03.660
And he's also told me...

10:03.660 --> 10:07.670
...that he treasures me very deeply.

10:09.250 --> 10:10.670
Asami.

10:10.670 --> 10:15.550
So no matter what happens,
my feelings will not change.

10:17.550 --> 10:20.140
He said that? What a noble soul.

10:21.140 --> 10:23.600
I must seem like
a world-class clueless idiot!

10:23.600 --> 10:25.720
I feel like dying.

10:26.430 --> 10:28.270
Manager...

10:32.270 --> 10:34.070
I'm sorry, Asami.

10:34.440 --> 10:36.990
If I could've told him
we were married...

10:36.990 --> 10:39.280
But you knew you
couldn't evade the issue.

10:39.280 --> 10:42.620
You were able to lay down the law
and make things clear.

10:43.160 --> 10:47.000
Moreover, what you said back there made me really happy, Darling.

10:47.000 --> 10:51.290
Because you made him realize that no meant no.

10:54.000 --> 10:58.010
"Newly Open"

10:56.300 --> 10:58.010
Morning, Asami-san.

10:58.010 --> 10:59.930
S-Sorry about last night.

11:01.720 --> 11:05.060
I've already forgotten everything that happened yesterday.

11:05.060 --> 11:09.600
Last night, my mind got blown right in front of my face.

11:10.980 --> 11:12.770
Asami-oneechan!

11:12.770 --> 11:14.060
Good morning.

11:14.060 --> 11:15.650
Morning~

11:15.650 --> 11:18.570
The manager was at
Mama's club last night.

11:19.530 --> 11:22.160
He ran us ragged until dawn.

11:22.160 --> 11:23.280
Until dawn?

11:23.280 --> 11:27.540
But yeah, I never knew cabaret clubs
were such fun places.

11:27.540 --> 11:30.250
I was hooked from the get-go.

11:30.660 --> 11:34.080
Sakura-san, let's stir things up again tonight!

11:34.080 --> 11:36.550
Only if the stirring ends
well before dawn.

11:36.550 --> 11:38.460
Hey, Sasuke, time to get to school.

11:38.460 --> 11:40.300
I'm going.

11:40.760 --> 11:42.130
Welcome.

11:42.130 --> 11:44.350
I'm going home to sleep. See ya.

11:45.050 --> 11:48.350
Thank goodness the manager's recovered.

11:49.390 --> 11:53.900
Say, Darling. We can't tell people we're married, but...

11:53.900 --> 11:58.730
...no matter what happens,
we'll get through it together, right?

11:58.730 --> 12:01.990
Because that's how much we love each other.

12:04.910 --> 12:06.580
My name is Asami.

12:06.580 --> 12:08.410
I'm a 17-year-old high school girl.

12:09.540 --> 12:12.830
I keep it secret from everyone, but...

12:12.830 --> 12:14.420
I'm actually married.

12:18.090 --> 12:19.210
Darling?

12:19.210 --> 12:21.880
Ahh, no, it's nothing.

12:23.720 --> 12:28.060
My husband, Ichimaru Kyousuke-sensei,
teaches at my school.

12:28.060 --> 12:29.600
Thanks for the meal.

12:30.310 --> 12:31.930
You going already?

12:32.310 --> 12:34.100
I have things to prepare.

12:35.480 --> 12:37.110
Preparations?

12:37.150 --> 12:42.030
Under the Starlit Skies...

12:42.780 --> 12:46.660
Today marks the beginning of a two-day, one-night school field trip.

12:46.660 --> 12:48.700
I've really been looking forward to it.

12:49.790 --> 12:51.790
My husband is also with us.

12:51.790 --> 12:54.580
Of course, we'll be staying
in separate rooms.

12:58.250 --> 12:59.590
Beautiful.

13:00.300 --> 13:03.090
Pretty nice place, isn't it?

13:03.090 --> 13:04.800
This looks like fun.

13:07.640 --> 13:09.010
Darling...

13:09.010 --> 13:11.520
All that luggage for a one-night trip?

13:12.220 --> 13:14.270
What could he have brought?

13:27.610 --> 13:28.620
Here you go.

13:28.620 --> 13:31.540
Woah, it looks so yummy.

13:31.540 --> 13:33.790
You're such a good cook, Asami.

13:33.790 --> 13:36.170
Huh? Where're the spoons?

13:36.170 --> 13:38.290
Ah, I forgot them.

13:38.290 --> 13:39.710
I'll go get them.

13:39.710 --> 13:40.710
'Kay.

13:51.310 --> 13:52.770
Darling?

13:53.890 --> 13:55.480
This place will work.

13:55.930 --> 13:57.850
A clear view of the sky...

13:58.940 --> 14:00.560
...and level ground.

14:00.560 --> 14:02.150
Darling.

14:04.070 --> 14:05.320
Asami.

14:05.820 --> 14:07.950
What are you up to?

14:09.070 --> 14:11.530
Here's the thing. You see...

14:13.200 --> 14:13.870
Got it?

14:14.120 --> 14:16.210
Okay, but what are we doing?

14:16.210 --> 14:18.870
That's a surprise for tonight.

14:19.790 --> 14:22.920
A surprise for tonight... Could it be...?

14:23.710 --> 14:25.800
It's time for you to find out.

14:25.800 --> 14:27.970
Oh my, Darling...!

14:27.970 --> 14:30.140
Ichimaru-sensei! Onohara-san!

14:34.890 --> 14:37.060
I-Iwasaki-sensei!

14:37.060 --> 14:39.980
T-Then, Ichimaru-sensei,
I'll see you later.

14:39.980 --> 14:41.560
Y-Yeah, sure!

14:49.530 --> 14:52.280
Didn't you promise me
you wouldn't see her anymore?

14:52.280 --> 14:54.950
W-Well yeah, but...

14:55.450 --> 14:57.410
I know.

14:57.830 --> 15:02.000
That you still haven't
gotten over Onohara-san.

15:03.540 --> 15:06.300
Even so, I still can't help myself...

15:06.300 --> 15:08.380
I-Iwasaki-sensei!

15:11.090 --> 15:14.180
Ahh! Come to think of it,
it's time for lunch.

15:14.680 --> 15:17.430
We wouldn't want to miss it,
so let's head back.

15:20.440 --> 15:22.310
I'm never going to give you up.

15:22.940 --> 15:26.730
We're staying overnight. There's still a chance.

15:31.610 --> 15:34.120
Asami, your breasts are so soft and tender.

15:33.660 --> 15:35.410
Cut it out, Satomi.

15:43.170 --> 15:45.790
That was a nice bath.

15:47.380 --> 15:49.300
What's the matter, Asami?

15:49.720 --> 15:51.680
Nothing at all.

16:09.690 --> 16:11.780
These vending machines
are so far away.

16:29.090 --> 16:32.720
Sneak out of your room after lights-out, and meet me here.

16:44.650 --> 16:46.520
All right, the coast is clear.

16:47.190 --> 16:50.070
All the little kiddies are in bed, right?

17:11.130 --> 17:12.590
Ichimaru-sensei?

17:12.590 --> 17:14.090
Aneki?

17:15.970 --> 17:17.050
Kouhei?

17:17.430 --> 17:20.560
What are you <i>doing</i> out here?

17:20.560 --> 17:22.310
Isn't it past bedtime?

17:22.310 --> 17:25.310
I was... thirsty.

17:25.310 --> 17:27.520
Why're <i>you</i> at
Ichimaru-sensei's room?

17:30.270 --> 17:32.320
But you're out of luck.

17:33.400 --> 17:35.780
Ichimaru-sensei is long-gone.

17:36.570 --> 17:39.320
He was lugging some large bags around.

17:42.910 --> 17:43.790
Foiled again!

17:51.380 --> 17:52.380
Geez.

17:55.470 --> 17:57.180
Asami?

18:01.350 --> 18:03.180
Darling!

18:07.440 --> 18:08.940
Asami!

18:11.730 --> 18:13.320
Did you wait long?

18:13.650 --> 18:15.820
I just got here too.

18:16.530 --> 18:18.950
So, what're we doing?

18:19.320 --> 18:21.030
Using this.

18:22.910 --> 18:25.500
It's an astronomical telescope...

18:25.500 --> 18:27.960
You weren't able to see them last time.

18:28.750 --> 18:30.580
Didn't I promise you...

18:31.750 --> 18:34.710
...that we'd go stargazing together?

18:35.510 --> 18:38.380
You've remembered that all this time?

18:38.380 --> 18:41.510
Yeah. It was kinda heavy, though.

18:42.050 --> 18:43.810
Go ahead, take a peek.

18:43.810 --> 18:44.510
Sure.

18:47.060 --> 18:50.150
Wah! How pretty.

18:51.100 --> 18:52.270
So pretty.

18:52.770 --> 18:54.110
Yeah, they are.

18:54.110 --> 18:56.650
<i>You're</i> so pretty, Asami.

18:57.150 --> 18:58.360
Huh?

18:59.490 --> 19:03.410
Asami, you glow brighter than any star.

19:03.950 --> 19:07.250
To me, you're a first-magnitude star.

19:07.250 --> 19:11.920
No, you shine even brighter than the first-magnitude stars.

19:13.130 --> 19:16.090
The same goes for you. In my eyes,

19:16.090 --> 19:18.590
you're more radiant
than any star could be.

19:19.510 --> 19:20.880
It's blinding.

19:21.340 --> 19:22.680
Asami.

19:23.260 --> 19:24.550
Darling.

19:24.550 --> 19:27.270
My, fancy meeting you two here!

19:31.350 --> 19:33.360
I-Iwasaki-sensei!?

19:33.360 --> 19:36.860
I was... taking a walk...

19:37.360 --> 19:41.240
...and I happened to see... your figures...

19:41.660 --> 19:43.570
You observing the stars?

19:43.570 --> 19:45.030
Uh, yeah.

19:45.030 --> 19:47.240
Please let me look too.

19:49.500 --> 19:52.750
Oh my, Onohara-san.
What are you doing here?

19:52.750 --> 19:54.710
U-Umm, well...

19:54.710 --> 19:56.750
Children should be in bed by now.

19:57.500 --> 19:59.710
It isn't quite what I planned, but...

19:59.710 --> 20:02.550
...this is a chance
to seduce Ichimaru-sensei.

20:02.550 --> 20:04.510
Go back to your room
and get to bed.

20:04.850 --> 20:06.560
O-Okay...

20:08.850 --> 20:10.310
That's more like it.

20:10.310 --> 20:13.190
Adult time begins now.

20:18.020 --> 20:19.650
Darling.

20:21.950 --> 20:24.530
The last obstacle has vanished.

20:24.530 --> 20:26.530
Iwasaki-sensei...

20:26.530 --> 20:30.450
The only ones watching us are the stars.

20:30.450 --> 20:34.040
Come now, don't hold back.

20:38.040 --> 20:39.880
Ichimaru-sensei!!

20:39.880 --> 20:41.970
Iwasaki-sensei!!

20:43.300 --> 20:45.640
W-Why did she come back?

20:45.890 --> 20:49.760
You teachers are sneaking out
alone to stargaze?

20:49.760 --> 20:51.220
That's unfair.

20:51.220 --> 20:54.810
She's right; please show us as well.

20:55.310 --> 20:56.440
Sure thing.

20:56.440 --> 20:57.610
Heck yeah!

20:57.610 --> 20:58.440
Yay!

21:03.240 --> 21:05.740
Whoa, they're so lovely.

21:05.740 --> 21:08.870
This is amazing... you can really see them.

21:25.630 --> 21:28.260
Now, if you'll look
towards the southeast...

21:28.260 --> 21:29.100
Southeast?

21:29.100 --> 21:32.430
The one shining brightest is Canis Major.

21:33.140 --> 21:35.690
That's the alpha star, Sirius.

21:36.770 --> 21:38.190
We covered this in class.

21:45.530 --> 21:48.700
I wish I may, I wish I might...

21:48.700 --> 21:53.540
...make many many more
shining memories with my husband...

21:53.540 --> 21:57.040
Far more than the number of stars twinkling in the sky tonight.

22:16.020 --> 22:19.520
All I am is a kitten

22:16.020 --> 22:19.520
watashi wa koneko

22:19.520 --> 22:23.440
All for you, and yours alone

22:19.520 --> 22:23.440
anata hitori dake no

22:23.440 --> 22:30.320
A naive little kitten; I want you to raise me right.

22:23.440 --> 22:30.320
mijuku na koneko sodatete hoshii no

22:30.870 --> 22:34.370
Can't you grant me this simple wish for anything

22:30.870 --> 22:34.370
nozomareru koto no subete ni

22:34.370 --> 22:38.540
and every last thing that I desire?

22:34.370 --> 22:38.540
kotaete yukeru kana

22:38.540 --> 22:41.960
If you stare at me with those longing, hungry eyes,

22:38.540 --> 22:41.960
nagai me de mitete kuretara

22:41.960 --> 22:47.880
I'll make this scene hotter and hotter just for you

22:41.960 --> 22:47.880
dokidoki sasete itte ageru

22:47.880 --> 22:55.270
Your kisses are like love vitamins,
so give me more and more of them.

22:47.880 --> 22:55.270
ai no bitamin kiss motto choudai

22:55.270 --> 23:02.190
Wrapped inside your loving arms so tight,
I can sleep again tonight.

22:55.270 --> 23:02.190
itoshii ude no naka kyou mo nemuru no

23:02.810 --> 23:12.320
Forever and ever only yours; just a kitten of love.

23:02.810 --> 23:12.320
zutto anata dake no ai no koneko

23:29.090 --> 23:44.980
Preview

23:29.970 --> 23:31.130
Asami here.

23:31.630 --> 23:34.430
We had a married couple's quarrel.

23:34.430 --> 23:38.980
It's just that I want my husband to pay more attention to me.

23:38.980 --> 23:42.980
So please, love me lots next week too.
